# Trim the build context.
#
# The vendored Emacs package tree stays in git but is not baked into the image:
# `make shell` bind-mounts it at /root/.emacs.d/elpa (ELPA_MOUNT in the Makefile) and
# `make update-emacs-packages` refreshes it. The rest of .emacs.d is copied to /root.
entrypoint/dotfiles/.emacs.d/elpa

# VCS metadata, host build trees, image-export tarballs.
.git
builddir/
debugBuild/
debugBuildInstall/
releaseBuild/
releaseBuildInstall/
sanitizeBuild-*/
*.tar
